[{"id":"iltaqa-3-13-6","words":["verb:iltaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"srele su se","en":"they (two) met"},{"bs":"pa se sreo","en":"so he/it met"},{"bs":"sreli ste se","en":"you (all) met"},{"bs":"susreću se","en":"they meet"}],"ref":"3:13","answerWord":"ٱلْتَقَتَا","answerSound":"audio/9ffafd2dadf039527ebf.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"There was a token for you in two hosts which met: one army fighting in the way of Allah, and another disbelieving, whom they saw as twice their number, clearly, with their very eyes. Thus Allah strengtheneth with His succour whom He will. Lo! herein verily is a lesson for those who have eyes.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"sresti se, susresti se","en":"to meet"},"passage":["قَدْ","كَانَ","لَكُمْ","ءَايَةٌ","فِى","فِئَتَيْنِ","ٱلْتَقَتَا","فِئَةٌ","تُقَٰتِلُ","فِى","سَبِيلِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَأُخْرَىٰ","كَافِرَةٌ","يَرَوْنَهُم","مِّثْلَيْهِمْ","رَأْىَ","ٱلْعَيْنِ","وَٱللَّهُ","يُؤَيِّدُ","بِنَصْرِهِۦ","مَن","يَشَآءُ","إِنَّ","فِى","ذَٰلِكَ","لَعِبْرَةً","لِّأُو۟لِى","ٱلْأَبْصَٰرِ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"الْتَقَى"}},{"id":"iltaqa-8-44-3","words":["verb:iltaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"sreli ste se","en":"you (all) met"},{"bs":"pa se sreo","en":"so he/it met"},{"bs":"srele su se","en":"they (two) met"},{"bs":"susreću se","en":"they meet"}],"ref":"8:44","answerWord":"ٱلْتَقَيْتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/7ff1fdb84b8761f581eb.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when He made you (Muslims), when ye met (them), see them with your eyes as few, and lessened you in their eyes, (it was) that Allah might conclude a thing that must be done. Unto Allah all things are brought back.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"sresti se, susresti se","en":"to meet"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","يُرِيكُمُوهُمْ","إِذِ","ٱلْتَقَيْتُمْ","فِىٓ","أَعْيُنِكُمْ","قَلِيلًا","وَيُقَلِّلُكُمْ","فِىٓ","أَعْيُنِهِمْ","لِيَقْضِىَ","ٱللَّهُ","أَمْرًا","كَانَ","مَفْعُولًا","وَإِلَى","ٱللَّهِ","تُرْجَعُ","ٱلْأُمُورُ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"الْتَقَى"}},{"id":"iltaqa-54-12-3","words":["verb:iltaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa se sreo","en":"so he/it met"},{"bs":"srele su se","en":"they (two) met"},{"bs":"sreli ste se","en":"you (all) met"},{"bs":"susreću se","en":"they meet"}],"ref":"54:12","answerWord":"فَٱلْتَقَى","answerSound":"audio/855be6edf951906e7084.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And caused the earth to gush forth springs, so that the waters met for a predestined purpose.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"sresti se, susresti se","en":"to meet"},"passage":["وَفَجَّرْنَا","ٱلْأَرْضَ","عُيُونًا","فَٱلْتَقَى","ٱلْمَآءُ","عَلَىٰٓ","أَمْرٍ","قَدْ","قُدِرَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"الْتَقَى"}}]